### 1. GET all rooms -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 2. minCapacity filter -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6

### 3. keyword filter -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?keyword=pod

### 4. combined filters -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6&keyword=roof

### 5. sort by capacity -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?sort=capacity

### 6. GET by ID -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2

### 7. GET by ID, not found -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 8. PUT -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Updated Seminar A", "capacity": 15 }

### 9. PUT, capacity too low -> 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Invalid Room", "capacity": 0 }

### 10. PUT, not found -> 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ghost Room", "capacity": 5 }

### 11. POST -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Meeting Room", "capacity": 10 }

### 12. POST, capacity too high -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Too Large Room", "capacity": 25 }

### 13. DELETE room without reservations -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/3

### 14. count -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/count

### 15. DELETE room with reservations -> 409
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 16. DELETE, not found -> 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99